    <widget class="QLabel" name="label_2">
     <property name="text">
      <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Estimates the staking interest earned on an amount of 1337, using the same reward rule the network applies today.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elite pays a flat yearly rate on coin age (amount x days held), so every stake earns the same rate whatever its size. Coins can stake after 1 hour, and there is no maximum age: coins that wait longer to stake earn proportionally more when they do.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Enter an amount below and press Enter or click Calculate.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
